implementationPlan.description:
Adversarial self-review of this task's diff. Load adversarial-self-review first.

Run mutation probes in scratch copies only, never the shared tree:
(1) Linux: restore the bare 'git' in diskState's defaultGitRunner. The sentinel test in cachedPlanPaths.test.ts must fail.
(2) Linux: drop the fully-qualified check so relative entries are accepted. gitExecutable.test.ts case (b) must fail.
(3) Linux: make a win32 miss return 'git'. Case (e) and the no-fallback test must fail.
(4) Windows-native: restore the bare 'git' in runGit. The planted test must fail.

Also check:
- resolution never happens at import time;
- two concurrent first calls are harmless (the resolver is synchronous and idempotent);
- empty, huge and quoted PATH values;
- a directory named git.exe on PATH is skipped (isFile);
- POSIX is untouched (no probes, bare 'git');
- error handling: every miss still degrades to undefined or a named miss, never a crash;
- no bare git spawn remains anywhere in src outside tests (grep execFile/spawn for 'git').

If anything changed, rerun the step-3 command fresh before complete_task.
